This repository contains patches against, and builds images from, the
following third-party projects. Their code is not vendored here; it is
fetched at the pinned commits at build time and remains under its own
license.

Excalidraw
  https://github.com/excalidraw/excalidraw (commit in UPSTREAM_COMMIT)
  Copyright (c) 2020 Excalidraw
  MIT License
  The files in patches/ are modifications of Excalidraw source files.

Excalidraw Libraries
  https://github.com/excalidraw/excalidraw-libraries (commit in LIBRARIES_COMMIT)
  Copyright (c) 2020 Excalidraw
  MIT License
  The files in patches-libraries/ are modifications of that site. The
  libraries in its catalog are published by their individual authors
  under the MIT License (as stated on the site); authors are listed in
  libraries.json.

The collaboration relay in server/src/server.js follows the socket.io
protocol of excalidraw-room (https://github.com/excalidraw/excalidraw-room,
MIT License, Copyright (c) 2020 Excalidraw).

Third-party npm dependencies of server/ and e2e/ are listed in their
package-lock.json files and carry their own licenses.
